        "original_id": "d3fdcb9c-2d12-5fc0-a53d-6bf5b8242b95",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Diplo, Justin Bieber, DJ Khaled, David Guetta, Quavo, Chance the Rapper, Lil Wayne\n- Songs: \"Bankroll\", \"I'm the One\", \"2U\"\n- Platforms: SoundCloud\n\nFacts:\n- \"I'm the One\" is a song written and performed by DJ Khaled, Justin Bieber, Quavo, Chance the Rapper, and Lil Wayne.\n- Justin Bieber was originally featured on Diplo's song \"Bankroll.\"\n- Justin Bieber had exclusive commitments related to DJ Khaled's \"I'm the One\" and David Guetta's \"2U\" around the time Diplo released \"Bankroll.\"\n- Diplo was forced to remove the original version of \"Bankroll\" from his SoundCloud account because Justin Bieber was originally featured on it while those exclusives were in place.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
